flowchart LR
    U[CSV / Excel billing export] --> V[Schema validation\nerrors + duplicate detection]
    V --> N[Normalization + daily aggregation]
    N --> B[Baselines\nprevious period / rolling / median-MAD]
    B --> D[Anomaly detection\nspike / drop / deviation]
    D --> E[Evidence + safe recommendations]
    D --> A[Alerts, acknowledgement, notes]
    N --> C[Cost drivers\nservice / project / region]
    N --> R[Usage vs rate analysis]
    D --> X[CSV / JSON audit exports]
    V --> DB[(SQLite persistence)]
    D --> DB
    A --> DB
    DB --> S[Streamlit dashboard]
    C --> S
    R --> S
